Z||000005||theogre||02-27-2001||08:10 PM||||Un fortunatly the exterior and interior rear view are required. A least the left side one is. The right one may be optional in some years. Before you yank them off you'll want to check that. Just moving them is usually not a problem. ||||reg||1
Z||000006||rogergarrison||02-28-2001||06:52 AM||||The law only says rearview mirrors because thats ordinarily the way to see behind and alongside you. Ive seen it done and its much safer and clearer with camera. Some models of Mercedes are now available with cameras instead of outside mirrors. If I had camera and got ticketed, Id definatly be in court.||||reg||1
